  "problem": "Suppose we want to measure the distance between two cities. Which metric unit could we use?",
  "worked_solution": "A table showing the units of length in metric units is given below.\n\n| Name | Symbol |\n| --- | --- |\n| Kilometer | $\\text{km}$ |\n| Meter | $\\text{m}$ |\n| Centimeter | $\\text{cm}$ |\n| Millimeter | $\\text{mm}$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nTherefore, from the given options, the only unit of length is $\\text{km}.$",
